  "question_text": "Match the following:\nMinister\nUnion Government\n(a)\nH.M. Patel\n(i)\nFinance Minister, N F Government\n(b)\nIndrajit Gupta\n(ii)\nDefence Minister, NDA-I\n(c)\nMadhu Dandavate\n(iii)\nFinance Minister, Janata Government\n(d)\nGeorge Fernandes\n(iv)\nHome Minister, UF Government\n\n\n\n(a)\n\n(i)\n\n(b) \n(ii)\n-I\n(c) \n(iii)\n\n(d) \n(iv)\n\nThe correct answer is\n\nQ.No\nSet A\nSet B\nSet C\nSet D\nQ.No\nSet A\nSet B\nSet C\nSet D\n5\n105\n6\n106\n7\n107\n8\n108\n9\n109\n10\n110\n11\n111\n12\n112\n13\n113\n14\n114\n15\n115\n16\n116\n17\n117\n18\n118\n19\n119\n20\n120\n21\n121\n22\n122\n23\n123\n24\n124\n25\n125\n26\n126\n27\n127\n28\n128\n29\n129\n30\n130\n31\n131\n32\n132\n33\n133\n34\n134\n35\n135\n36\n136\n37\n137\n38\n138\n39\n139\n40\n140\n41\n141\n42\n142\n43\n143\n44\n144\n45\n145\n46\n146\n47\n147\n48\n148\n49\n149\n50\n150\nTSLPRBT-PC-FWE-2016\nQ.No Set A\nSet B\nSet C\nSet D\nQ.No Set A\nSet B\nSet C\nSet D\n51\n151\n52\n152\n53\n153\n54\n154\n55\n155\n56\n156\n57\n157\n58\n158\n59\n159\n60\n160\n61\n161\n62\n162\n63\n163\n64\n164\n65\n165\n66\n166\n67\n167\n68\n168\n69\n169\n70\n170\n71\n171\n72\n172\n73\n173\n74\n174\n75\n175\n76\n176\n77\n177\n78\n178\n79\n179\n80\n180\n81\n181\n82\n182\n83\n183\n84\n184\n85\n185\n86\n186\n87\n187\n88\n188\n89\n189\n90\n190\n91\n191\n92\n192\n93\n193\n94\n194\n95\n195\n96\n196\n97\n197\n98\n198\n99\n199\n100\n200",
